    "hour": {
      "params": ["t"],
      "description": "UTC hour 0..23 of t, the value datetime.hour gives (esm-spec §9.2): floor(s / 3600), with s = floor(t) - 86400 floor(floor(t) / 86400) the whole second of the day. Finite t with |t| < 2^52 s; outside it, and for NaN or an infinite t, the value is NaN (0/0).",
